     "barter",
     "coin",
     "digital"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "In barter, goods are exchanged without money. It needs a double coincidence of wants: each person must want what the other has.\nCoins of metal, then paper notes, made trade easier. Money works as a medium of exchange, a store of value and a unit of account.\nToday we also pay by cards and UPI, which are digital money."
    }
